      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n\n<Subject 1> is 小豆丁, the six-year-old boy established in the reference character design, with round cheeks, large bright eyes, two upward-pointing hair buns, and a lively childlike appearance. In the target video, his identity and facial features remain consistent, while his clothing is changed to a neat first-grade elementary-school uniform with a small school backpack. His appearance in the opening heroic moment and later real-world school scene remains the same character.\n\n<Picture 1> is the first-frame reference for [Shot 1], showing 小豆丁 from a low-angle perspective leaping in front of a gigantic golden Chinese character \"泽\", with a towering golden water curtain erupting behind him. It establishes the opening heroic composition, character pose, the large-scale \"泽\" visual motif, and the dramatic golden-water lighting.\n\nsummary:\n\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video begins from <Picture 1>, preserving <Subject 1>'s heroic leap, the gigantic \"泽\" character, and the towering golden water curtain before transforming the golden water into warm morning sunlight. The video then returns to the real world at an elementary-school entrance, where <Subject 1> walks into school in his first-grade uniform while a translucent golden \"泽\" gradually dissolves into sunlight and floating particles. A warm female voiceover delivers the provided Chinese blessing during the final transition.\n\nretention_analysis:\n\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): partially_preserved - 小豆丁's character identity, childlike facial features, hairstyle, and overall visual continuity are preserved, while his clothing changes from the heroic fantasy presentation to a neat first-grade school uniform and backpack in the real-world sequence.\n\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the low-angle heroic framing, 小豆丁's airborne pose, gigantic \"泽\", and erupting golden water curtain are retained as the exact opening visual state before the transition begins.\n\ndetailed_description:\n\nThe target video uses a Chinese animated cinematic style combining 国潮美学, Eastern fantasy, traditional decorative patterns, exaggerated comic proportions, bold hard-edged linework, dramatic lighting, and a balance of heroic intensity with playful warmth. The visual language begins with a spectacular fantasy climax and gradually transitions into a bright, gentle real-world school morning, using golden light and flowing water imagery as the visual bridge.\n\n[Shot 1] The video opens directly from <Picture 1> at 0.00 seconds. A low-angle heroic shot looks upward at <Subject 1>, 小豆丁, as he leaps dynamically across the foreground in front of the enormous golden Chinese character \"泽\". Behind him, a magnificent golden water curtain surges vertically into the sky, composed of translucent flowing water, luminous highlights, and stylized traditional water-wave motifs. His body is suspended at the peak of the leap, with his clothing and hair lifted by the rushing energy. The huge \"泽\" dominates the background while golden reflections illuminate the edges of his figure. The camera holds the dramatic low-angle composition briefly, then begins a slow upward push as the fantasy energy starts to soften.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the golden water curtain gradually loses its physical form. Individual streams stretch upward and dissolve into countless warm golden particles. The gigantic \"泽\" remains visible behind <Subject 1> for a moment, but its hard edges become increasingly translucent, as if the character itself is being dissolved by sunlight. The water-wave patterns flatten into luminous streaks while the intense fantasy lighting becomes softer and more natural. The camera continues the upward movement through the glowing particles, creating a seamless visual transition from the ancient-fantasy world into morning light.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.000, the image cuts back to the real world at the entrance of an elementary school in the early morning. Warm sunlight fills the school gate, with a thin layer of mist drifting through the campus. Trees line the entrance, and their leaves sway gently in the morning breeze. <Subject 1> now wears a clean first-grade elementary-school uniform and carries a small school backpack. He stands near the school entrance with his back partially turned toward the campus, then turns his head and upper body toward the camera. He gives a confident, bright, slightly mischievous smile. After holding the smile for a brief beat, he turns back toward the school and begins walking forward with light, energetic steps. The camera settles behind him and starts a low-angle tracking shot, following his movement into the campus.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, the camera continues tracking slowly behind <Subject 1> as he walks farther into the school. A gigantic translucent golden \"泽\" gradually appears behind him, formed organically from warm sunlight and flowing water-like light rather than looking like a rigid floating graphic. The character follows the perspective of the environment and softly illuminates the surrounding mist and tree leaves. The female narrator (S1), with a warm, gentle, luminous, encouraging voice, speaks in an affectionate voiceover while <Subject 1>'s lips remain completely closed: <d>[Chinese] 温润、发光、有勇气——这就是“泽”字送给你的祝福。儿子，带着这个字，去上一年级吧！</d> As the final words continue, the golden \"泽\" breaks apart into thousands of tiny luminous particles. The particles drift outward toward the school buildings, tree leaves, and open morning sky, gradually becoming indistinguishable from the surrounding sunlight. <Subject 1> continues walking without looking back. The camera slowly rises with small amplitude at slow speed, changing from the low rear-following perspective toward a higher, wider view. The boy becomes progressively smaller while the school campus expands across the frame. By the final moment at 10.00 seconds, only a warm shaft of golden sunlight remains clearly illuminating <Subject 1>, while the surrounding campus, trees, mist, and sky fill the increasingly expansive composition.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nSoft early-morning outdoor ambience emerges as the fantasy water energy fades, including a gentle breeze, delicate leaf movement, distant elementary-school activity, and quiet footsteps from 小豆丁. The fantasy opening contains a broad rushing-water texture that gradually dissolves into airy particles and natural morning ambience. His footsteps remain light and rhythmic as he walks deeper into the campus.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nA cinematic Chinese-orchestral score begins with low, resonant percussion, broad strings, and bright traditional Chinese instrumental accents during the heroic opening. As the golden water transforms into sunlight, the arrangement gradually becomes lighter, introducing soft bamboo-flute tones and sustained strings at a moderate-slow tempo. The music reaches a warm, restrained final swell during the voiceover and gently tapers as the camera rises over the school campus.\n\n"
